      "patterns": [
        "(?i)^cwe$"
      ],
      "description": "Common Weakness Enumeration",
      "weight": 100,
      "data": {
        "official_name": "Common Weakness Enumeration",
        "common_name": "CWE",
        "alternate_names": null,
        "description": "The canonical software and hardware weakness taxonomy, operated by MITRE.",
        "notes": "Hierarchical taxonomy with three structural levels: views (organize weaknesses by perspective, e.g., CWE-1000 Research Concepts), groupings/categories (group related weaknesses, e.g., CWE-19 Data Processing Errors; renamed from Category to Grouping in CWE 5.0 / Schema 8.0), and weaknesses (specific flaw types, e.g., CWE-79 XSS). Over 950 weakness entries (1,477 total entries in CWE 5.0). Referenced by CVE, NVD, and virtually all vulnerability databases.\n\nAI/ML weaknesses added in the CWE-1400 series: CWE-1425 (Weaknesses Related to AI/ML Products view), CWE-1426 (Improper Validation of Generative AI Output), CWE-1427 (Improper Neutralization of Input for LLM Prompting), CWE-1434 (Insecure ML Model Inference Parameters).\n\nMultiple representations: Every CWE identifier resolves to its HTML definition page on cwe.mitre.org (weight 100, text/html) as well as to the official MITRE CWE REST API JSON endpoints at https://cwe-api.mitre.org/api/v1/ (weakness record endpoint /cwe/weakness/{num} at weight 50 and universal entry-type lookup /cwe/{num} at weight 40, application/json). Filter with ?content_type=application/json to return only REST API endpoints.",
        "urls": [
          {
            "type": "website",
            "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org"
          },
          {
            "type": "api",
            "url": "https://cwe-api.mitre.org/api/v1/",
            "parsability": "structured",
            "schema": "secid:reference/mitre.org/cwe-schema@8.0",
            "auth": "none",
            "note": "Official MITRE CWE REST API (updated for CWE 5.0 / Schema 8.0). Endpoints: /cwe/version, /cwe/{ids}, /cwe/weakness/{ids}, /cwe/category/{ids}, /cwe/view/{ids}, and /cwe/{id}/{parents|children|ancestors|descendants}."
          },
          {
            "type": "docs",
            "url": "https://github.com/CWE-CAPEC/REST-API-wg/blob/main/Quick%20Start.md",
            "note": "CWE REST API Quick Start instructions and OpenAPI specification"
          },
          {
            "type": "docs",
            "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/index.html",
            "note": "CWE data index — links to XML, CSV, and PDF downloads"
